gress Colors":["Edenemise v\u00e4rvid"],"Bar Start":["Riba algus"],"Bar End":["Riba l\u00f5pp"],"Icon Background":["Ikooni taust"],"Truck Background":["Veoki taust"],"Truck Icon":["Veoki ikoon"],"Tier Reached":["Tase saavutatud"],"Tier Icon":["Taseme ikoon"],"Qualified Colors":["Kvalifitseerumise v\u00e4rvid"],"Shield (Protection)":["Kilp (kaitse)"],"Heart":["S\u00fcda"],"Sparkles":["S\u00e4delus"],"Use whole currency units.":["Kasuta t\u00e4isarvulisi valuuta\u00fchikuid."],"Use no more than %d decimal place.":["Kasuta mitte rohkem kui %d komakoht.","Kasuta mitte rohkem kui %d komakohta."],"Enter a positive charge of at least %s.":["Sisesta positiivne tasu v\u00e4hemalt %s."],"This draft will not be saved until corrected.":["Seda mustandit ei salvestata enne, kui vead on parandatud."],"Configure add-on options that customers can toggle in the cart drawer.":["Seadista lisavalikud, mida kliendid saavad ostukorvisahtlis sisse v\u00f5i v\u00e4lja l\u00fclitada."],"Shipping Protection":["Tarnekaitse"],"Enable Shipping Protection":["Luba tarnekaitse"],"Allow customers to add shipping protection to their order.":["Luba klientidel lisada oma tellimusele tarnekaitse."],"Description":["Kirjeldus"],"Protect your order from damage or loss":["Kaitse oma tellimust kahjustuste v\u00f5i kadumise eest"],"Price":["Hind"],"Show Icon":["Kuva ikoon"],"Display an icon next to the add-on in the cart drawer.":["Kuva ostukorvisahtlis lisavaliku k\u00f5rval ikoon."],"Default State":["Vaikimisi olek"],"Whether the add-on is toggled on or off by default for new visitors.":["Kas lisavalik on uutele k\u00fclastajatele vaikimisi sisse v\u00f5i v\u00e4lja l\u00fclitatud."],"Off (customer opts in)":["V\u00e4ljas (klient l\u00fclitab ise sisse)"],"On (customer opts out)":["Sees (klient loobub)"],"WooCommerce minimum":["WooCommerce miinimum"],"Free shipping comes from WooCommerce, not from this meter. Add a Free shipping method with a minimum order amount to your shipping zones in WooCommerce \u2192